{"articles":[{"no":"第一點","path":[],"text":"雲林縣政府為審慎處理違反公寓大廈管理條例（以下簡稱本條例）事件，並兼顧裁罰之明確性、適當性與公平性及符合比例原則，以減少裁罰爭議及提升行政效率，特訂定本基準。","id":"雲林縣-GL001120/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"5a848c4d3d4e0b7614ff9d63c19a57c7f6a1d9c09e744bdf87ae81f9dd2dada6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}},{"no":"第二點","path":[],"text":"違反本條例事件裁罰基準如附表。但案件情節特殊，有加重或減輕之必要者，得敘明加重或減輕之理由，於法定罰鍰額度內，加重或減輕處罰。","id":"雲林縣-GL001120/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"04fabdcf7f33a85790a8a32d1d78400dbbd81761a6796cd16ff9aadbbdc80aa6","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"unparsed","method":"raw-text-v1","units":[],"reason":"來源有換行與排版混用；尚未核實項款邊界。"}}],"attachments":[{"title":"雲林縣政府處理違反公寓大廈管理條例事件裁罰基準.pdf","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=26036&id=GL001120&type=LAW"},{"title":"雲林縣政府處理違反公寓大廈管理條例事件裁罰基準-附表.pdf","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/Download.ashx?FileID=26037&id=GL001120&type=LAW"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"","id":"雲林縣-GL001120","keywords":[],"kind":"地方規定","modified":"","name":"雲林縣政府處理違反公寓大廈管理條例事件裁罰基準","region":"雲林縣","source":"雲林縣法規查詢系統","status":"來源現行頁","url":"https://law.yunlin.gov.tw/LawContent.aspx?id=GL001120","retrieved":"2026-09-29T00:37:02+00:00","snapshot":"","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"60d17b891074a6585991a80bd06bc0ae39c3975d7b8d9d533e9843c2c02d5950","sourceRecordId":"雲林縣-GL001120","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-29T00:39:28+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"","effectiveDate":""}}